### ❌ Unpublish Product
PATCH {{url_dev}}/product/69ae563f9c631d4772f037e8/unpublish
x-api-key: {{api_key}}
authorization: {{access_token}}
x-client-id: {{client_id}}


### 📦 Get Published Products
GET {{url_dev}}/product/published/all?limit=10&skip=0
x-api-key: {{api_key}}
authorization: {{access_token}}
x-client-id: {{client_id}}

### 🚀 Publish Product
PATCH {{url_dev}}/product/69e461c5b91cb778d225b472/publish
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{api_key}}
authorization: {{access_token}}
x-client-id: {{client_id}}


